          "value": "<h2>Statement for <span style=\"color:#1d4ed8\">{Fields.customer}</span></h2><p>Mixed styles on one line: <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underlined</u>, <s>struck</s>, <span style=\"font-size:13pt;color:#b91c1c\">large red</span>, <span style=\"background-color:#fef08a\">highlighted</span>, H<sub>2</sub>O and E = mc<sup>2</sup>. A long sentence wraps across lines inside the box and keeps every style where it was, including <b>bold <i>bold italic</i></b> runs that change in the middle of a <b>wo</b>rd.</p><p style=\"text-align:right\">Right-aligned paragraph &mdash; with an <a href=\"https://example.com/terms\">example link</a>.</p>"
